Montserrat
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Four faces (Regular, Medium, SemiBold and Bold), version 9.000, are compiled
into InstallerClean.exe as WPF resources. They draw the interface text in
Russian, Ukrainian and Vietnamese, whose letters Poppins lacks, and in the
other languages any character Poppins lacks and Montserrat has, such as the
sort arrows in the Details windows.

  https://github.com/JulietaUla/Montserrat

They are a modified version of the files in that repository's fonts/ttf/
folder at commit 555facfb2a18c72c3c0380f0d9c0f060453a9058: their line spacing
is Poppins's, and the Greek letters are out of their character maps.
scripts/fonts/make-montserrat.py in this repository makes them. Montserrat has
no Reserved Font Name, so they keep the name.

Their own name table declares:

