Material Icons
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two icons are Google's Material Icons in their filled style, with their path
data unchanged: the heart on the donate buttons is "favorite" and the tick in a
ticked checkbox is "check". They are compiled into InstallerClean.exe as part
of the windows' markup.

  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

They are src/action/favorite/materialicons/24px.svg and
src/navigation/check/materialicons/24px.svg in that repository, which
publishes them under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the licence
InstallerClean itself is under. Its full text is in LICENSE.

