Inno Setup translation files
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

InstallerClean-<version>-setup.exe is built with Inno Setup. Five of its wizard
languages come from Inno Setup's collection of user-contributed translations at
https://jrsoftware.org/files/istrans/ and are carried in this repository under
installer/Languages/. Japanese is carried there too, and is described after the
five. The rest come with Inno Setup itself and are not files in this
repository. All of them are compiled into the setup rather than installed with
it.

Each of the five keeps its own header, including its translator's contact
details. The attributions in them:

  ChineseSimplified.isl
    *** Inno Setup version 6.5.0+ Chinese Simplified messages ***
    Maintainer: Zhenghan Yang (Kira)
    Github: https://github.com/kira-96/Inno-Setup-Chinese-Simplified-Translation
    Translation based on network resource

  ChineseTraditional.isl
    *** Inno Setup version 6.5.0+ Chinese Traditional messages ***
    Name: GoneTone
    Based on translations by: Anbang LI, Enfong Tsao
    Based on 5.5.3+ translations by Samuel Lee
    Translation based on network resource

  Indonesian.isl
    *** Inno Setup version 6.5.0+ Indonesian messages ***
    Alih bahasa oleh: MozaikTM
    Updated for Inno Setup 6.5.0+ by Edward Tie

  Italian.isl
    *** Inno Setup version 6.5.0+ Italian messages ***
    Translator name: bovirus
    Based on previous translations of Rinaldo M. aka Whiteshark
